(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: NATIONAL SC-ST HUB \(NSSH\) SCHEME \(NSSH\) / NATIONAL SMALL INDUSTRIES CORPORATION \(NSIC\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Specialized affirmative support ecosystem to empower SC/ST micro and small) Tj
T*
(entrepreneurs to fulfill the 4% mandatory public procurement quota by CPSEs) Tj
T*
(and ministries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Enterprise owned by SC/ST entrepreneurs \(100% ownership in sole) Tj
T*
(   proprietorship, or at least 51% equity in partnership/company\).) Tj
T*
(2. Valid Udyam Registration and Caste Certificate of promoter.) Tj
T*
(3. Applicant must be engaged in manufacturing or provision of services.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. 100% reimbursement of Single Point Registration Scheme \(SPRS\) fees, 100%) Tj
T*
(   annual credit guarantee fee reimbursement under CGTMSE, up to Rs. 1 Lakh) Tj
T*
(   subsidy for trade fairs, and subsidized tender document fees.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 2.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Caste Certificate issued by Competent Authority) Tj
T*
(2. Udyam Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(3. GST Registration Certificate) Tj
T*
(4. Proof of shareholding pattern \(CA certificate for) Tj
T*
(   companies/partnerships\)) Tj
T*
(5. Bank Account details) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via National SC-ST Hub Portal / NSIC offices) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.scsthub.in/) Tj
T*
